sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant ChatbotWidget as ChatbotWidget.jsx
    participant AxiosAPI as api.js (Axios)
    participant DjangoView as ChatAPIView
    participant ORM as Django ORM
    participant DB as SQLite / PostgreSQL
    participant Gemini as Google Gemini API

    User->>ChatbotWidget: Types message & clicks Send
    ChatbotWidget->>AxiosAPI: POST /api/tourism/chat/
    AxiosAPI->>DjangoView: HTTP POST with JSON body

    Note over DjangoView: Validate message

    DjangoView->>DjangoView: Load GEMINI_API_KEY
    DjangoView->>DjangoView: genai.configure(api_key)

    Note over DjangoView: Context Search Phase

    DjangoView->>ORM: Attraction.objects.filter(...)[:3]
    ORM->>DB: SELECT FROM tourism_attraction
    DB-->>ORM: Matching rows
    ORM-->>DjangoView: Attraction QuerySet

    DjangoView->>ORM: Hotel.objects.filter(...)[:3]
    ORM->>DB: SELECT FROM hospitality_hotel
    DB-->>ORM: Matching rows
    ORM-->>DjangoView: Hotel QuerySet

    DjangoView->>ORM: Product.objects.filter(...)[:3]
    ORM->>DB: SELECT FROM marketplace_product
    DB-->>ORM: Matching rows
    ORM-->>DjangoView: Product QuerySet

    Note over DjangoView: Build context + compose prompt

    DjangoView->>Gemini: model.generate_content(prompt)
    Gemini-->>DjangoView: AI response text

    DjangoView-->>AxiosAPI: HTTP 200 JSON response
    AxiosAPI-->>ChatbotWidget: response.data.response
    ChatbotWidget->>User: Displays AI response in chat
